Let $(x,\mu,\lambda)\in\mathbb{R}^{n+\ell+m}$. If $\{
abla h_j(x):j=1,\ldots,\ell\}\cup\{
abla g_i(x):i\in I_0\}$ is linearly independent and $J_x\mathbf L(x,\mu,\lambda)$ is positive definite on the common null space of $\{
abla h_j(x):j=1,\ldots,\ell\}\cup\{
abla g_i(x):i\in I_+\}$, then ESSC holds at $(x,\mu,\lambda)$.
